## How to run locally

```powershell
composer install
npm install
php artisan migrate --seed
php artisan serve        # terminal 1
npm run dev              # terminal 2
```

`.env` additions used by the seeder (creates the admin account):
```
ADMIN_NAME="Cap"
ADMIN_EMAIL=you@example.com
ADMIN_PASSWORD=change-me-please
```
The partner account is created by the admin at **Admin → Users**. Planned extra process for chat: `php artisan reverb:start`.

---

## Routes (`routes/web.php`)

| Method | URI | Controller | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET / POST | `/login` | `AuthController@create / store` | Guest |
| GET | `/` | `HomeController` | Home dashboard |
| POST | `/logout` | `AuthController@destroy` | |
| GET / POST | `/checkins` | `CheckinController@index / store` | One per day; saving again updates today's |
| DELETE | `/checkins/{checkin}` | `CheckinController@destroy` | Owner only |
| resource | `/journal` (param `entry`) | `JournalController` | index, create, store, show, edit, update, destroy |
| GET / PATCH | `/settings/profile` | `ProfileController@edit / update` | |
| GET / PATCH | `/settings/preferences` | `SettingsController@edit / update` | Theme, notifications, gamification |
| GET / PATCH | `/settings/privacy` | `PrivacyController@edit / update` | |
| GET / PUT | `/settings/password` | `PasswordController@edit / update` | |
| GET / POST / PATCH | `/admin/users[/{user}]` | `Admin\UserController` | `role:admin` only |

All routes except login sit behind the `auth.session` middleware.

