## Backend files

### Enums (`app/Enums`)
| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `Role.php` | `admin`, `user`. Cast on `User.role`. |
| `Visibility.php` | `private`, `shared`. Used on check-ins, journal entries and the default-visibility privacy setting. |
| `Mood.php` | `happy, loved, excited, calm, okay, tired, sad, anxious, stressed`. Validated on check-ins. |
| `JournalType.php` | `diary`, `dream`. |

### Migrations (`database/migrations`)
Fixed filenames, so the order is stable.

| File | Creates |
|---|---|
| `2026_11_16_000001_create_users_table` | `users`: name, unique email, password, `role`, `is_active`, `last_login_at` |
| `..._000002_create_profiles_table` | `profiles`: one per user. display_name, nickname, avatar_path, birthday, bio, timezone (default `UTC`) |
| `..._000003_create_user_settings_table` | `user_settings`: theme, notifications_enabled, `notification_previews` (default off), `gamification_enabled` |
| `..._000004_create_privacy_settings_table` | `privacy_settings`: `share_usage_summary` (default off), `default_entry_visibility` (default private) |
| `..._000006_drop_api_tokens_table` | Drops the `api_tokens` table from the abandoned token-auth approach |
| `..._000007_create_sessions_table` | `sessions` for database sessions (skips if the table already exists) |
| `..._000008_create_daily_checkins_table` | `daily_checkins`: unique (`user_id`, `checkin_date`), mood, note, visibility |
| `..._000009_create_journal_entries_table` | `journal_entries`: type, title, body, entry_date, visibility, with indexes for owner and shared lookups |

`..._000005_create_api_tokens_table` was deleted during the move to Inertia and session auth.

### Models (`app/Models`)
| File | Key points |
|---|---|
| `User.php` | Role, `is_active` and hashed-password casts. `booted()` auto-creates a profile, settings and privacy row for every new user. `authStamp()` is a hash of the password stored in the session, so a password change signs out every other session. `isAdmin()`. Relations: `profile`, `settings`, `privacy`. |
| `Profile.php` | Profile fields, `birthday` cast to date. |
| `UserSetting.php` | Boolean casts for the three toggles. |
| `PrivacySetting.php` | `default_entry_visibility` cast to the `Visibility` enum. |
| `DailyCheckin.php` | `scopeOwnedBy`, `todayFor($user)` (today's date in the user's own timezone). |
| `JournalEntry.php` | `scopeOwnedBy`, `scopeSharedWith($viewer)` (other people's shared entries), `canBeViewedBy($user)`, `todayFor($user)`. |

### Middleware (`app/Http/Middleware`)
| File | Alias | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `ResolveSessionUser.php` | (web group) | Reads `auth_user_id` and `auth_stamp` from the session, loads the user with profile and settings, and rejects inactive users or a stale stamp. Sets the request's user resolver. |
| `RequireLogin.php` | `auth.session` | Redirects guests to `/login`. |
| `EnsureRole.php` | `role` | `->middleware('role:admin')`. Returns 403 for other roles. |
| `HandleInertiaRequests.php` | (web group) | Shares `auth.user` (id, name, email, role, display_name, theme), `flash.status` and the app name with every page. |

### Controllers (`app/Http/Controllers`)
| File | Methods |
|---|---|
| `AuthController.php` | `create` (login page), `store` (rate-limited to 5 tries per minute per email and IP, regenerates the session, stores `auth_user_id` and `auth_stamp`, sets `last_login_at`), `destroy` (invalidates the session) |
| `HomeController.php` | `__invoke`: renders Home with today's mood, if any |
| `PasswordController.php` | `edit`, `update` (verifies the current password, keeps this session alive, signs out all others) |
| `ProfileController.php` | `edit`, `update` |
| `SettingsController.php` | `edit`, `update` (also used by the dark mode toggle) |
| `PrivacyController.php` | `edit` (settings plus the "who can see what" summary), `update` |
| `CheckinController.php` | `index` (today's entry plus the last 60), `store` (`updateOrCreate` for today), `destroy` (owner only) |
| `JournalController.php` | Full resource. `index` supports tabs: all, diary, dream, shared (with me). Private helpers: `ownedOrFail` (404 for non-owners) and `payload`. |
| `Admin/UserController.php` | `index`, `store`, `update` (activate or deactivate, blocks self-deactivation). Never exposes anyone's private content. |

### Form requests (`app/Http/Requests`)
`Auth/LoginRequest`, `Auth/ChangePasswordRequest`, `UpdateProfileRequest`, `UpdateSettingsRequest`, `UpdatePrivacyRequest`, `Admin/StoreUserRequest`, `Admin/UpdateUserRequest`, `StoreCheckinRequest`, `StoreJournalEntryRequest` (used for both create and update).

### Other backend files
| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `bootstrap/app.php` | Registers web routes, appends `ResolveSessionUser` then `HandleInertiaRequests` to the web group, and defines the `auth.session` and `role` aliases. |
| `routes/web.php` | All routes (table above). |
| `app/Providers/AppServiceProvider.php` | Password defaults (min 10 characters). Also defines the `login` and `api` rate limiters, which are currently unused (login throttling lives in `AuthController`). |
| `database/factories/UserFactory.php` | Test users, with an `admin()` state. |
| `database/seeders/DatabaseSeeder.php` | Creates the admin from the `ADMIN_*` env vars. |

### Deleted during the move to session auth
`ApiToken` model, `AuthenticateToken` middleware, `routes/api.php`, the `api_tokens` migration, and the four JSON API Resources.

